OL,3,GNEWSAFears A50 closures will add to
OL,4,Aroad 'chaos'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo weeks of overnight closures on two
OL,7,Fstretches of a major route between the
OL,8,FM1 and M6 will add to "absolute chaos"
OL,9,Fon surrounding roads, a councillor
OL,10,Fsays.
OL,12,FStarting on Tuesday, two sections of
OL,13,Fthe A50 westbound from Doveridge in
OL,14,FDerbyshire to Blythe Bridge,
OL,15,FStaffordshire, are shutting between
OL,16,F20:00 and 05:00 BST on weeknights for
OL,17,Fresurfacing works.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
