OL,3,GNEWSAFears A50 closures will add to
OL,4,Aroad 'chaos'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn an update sent to affected
OL,7,Fresidents, National Highways said the
OL,8,Frepairs were to ensure the route
OL,9,Fcontinued to "meet the required
OL,10,Fmaintenance standards".
OL,12,FCouncillor Stephanie Akerman, who
OL,13,Fchairs Checkley Parish Council, said
OL,14,Fexisting works diverting traffic
OL,15,Fthrough the village of Tean were
OL,16,Falready causing a "pinch point".
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
